<title>USA: Kimco Realty names Michael Pappagallo CFO.</title>
<headline>Kimco Realty names Michael Pappagallo CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW HYDE PARK, NY 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kimco Realty Corp said Thursday that it has named Michael Pappagallo chief financial officer, effective May 27.</p>
<p>Pappagallo is currently chief financial officer of General Electric Corp's  $14 billion Commercial Real Estate Financing &amp; Services business.</p>
<p>He replaces Louis Petra, who the company said stepped down in January to pursue entrepreneurial activities within the organization.</p>
